  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Debug The Route Planner\r\n\r\n1. Run the app to display the initial route.\r\n\r\n2. Click **Add New Stop** and **Remove Last Stop** to modify the route.\r\n\r\n3. **Observe** what goes wrong:\r\n\r\n   * When does the data become inconsistent?\r\n   * What looks incorrect in the cards?\r\n\r\n4. Send your hypothesis to AI and ask for a second opinion:\r\n\r\n\r\n   > *I think the bug is caused by ______ because ______. What do you think?*\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n5. Fix the bug.\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
